<title>USA: SA Telecomm gets $10 mln credit line.</title>
<headline>SA Telecomm gets $10 mln credit line.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>SA Telecommunications Inc Wednesday said it completed the arrangement of a $10 million line of credit with Greyrock Business Credit, a division of NationsCredit Commercial Corp, which is an affiliate of NationsBank Corp.</p>
</text>
